% Targets, bases and versions.

### name: dialect.base-is-not-a-target
--- note
ansi names no server anyone runs. A dialect no database implements is not one
a caller should be able to aim at.
--- dialect
ansi
--- source
1 + 1
--- error
E_SQL_DIALECT
===
### name: dialect.mysql-family-is-a-base-too
--- dialect
mysql-family
--- source
1 + 1
--- error
E_SQL_DIALECT
===
