### name: dialect.mariadb-inherits-from-both-bases
--- note
MOD comes from ansi, CONCAT from mysql-family, and nothing restates either.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- source
(5 % 3) & "x"
--- expect
CONCAT(MOD(5, 3), 'x')
